{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALTERA is a military survival sandbox.  Become the ultimate troop commander &amp; lead your faction to victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a 64 km\u00b2 game world with diverse regions and unique points of interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for territory: over 40 areas can be captured and controlled by factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent world with customizable game rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with NPCs to receive quests and uncover dynamic world events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon modification and customization system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced base building and crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between first-person and third-person perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully dynamic day/night cycle and weather system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creation and customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faction management: develop infrastructure and assign missions to subordinates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Troop management: recruit, equip, and command soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression and skill development system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, in co-op, or host your own dedicated server.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE, PvP, or both combined\u00a0(custom game rules on every server).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Troops &amp; Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist soldiers who will follow you and execute your commands. Station soldiers on your bases and give them various tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/46b17468dc91b8e2f0a8b45880e8cad6.poster.avif?t=1774550038\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/46b17468dc91b8e2f0a8b45880e8cad6.webm?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/46b17468dc91b8e2f0a8b45880e8cad6.mp4?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Territory Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hostile factions and capture their territory. Protect your bases and territory from enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/8fe7b6db3c9d071e8b655af58b998347.poster.avif?t=1774550038\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/8fe7b6db3c9d071e8b655af58b998347.webm?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/8fe7b6db3c9d071e8b655af58b998347.mp4?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Building and Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use collected resources to build your own bases, facilities, and craft items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/93cb230fea649bcb71f97a66eb7019d4.poster.avif?t=1774550038\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/93cb230fea649bcb71f97a66eb7019d4.webm?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/93cb230fea649bcb71f97a66eb7019d4.mp4?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Creator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character and customize your appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/5f5810fcfbf60b70bbd40f40f40d5d61.poster.avif?t=1774550038\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/5f5810fcfbf60b70bbd40f40f40d5d61.webm?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/5f5810fcfbf60b70bbd40f40f40d5d61.mp4?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/796530?t=1774550038","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/796530?t=1774550038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/5eaed4c67ccb868f7c3d2a6f11c81300a37c6d1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774550038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/5eaed4c67ccb868f7c3d2a6f11c81300a37c6d1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774550038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes general mature content and frequent violence."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/767c5d9e6ab7caf1ece48d6924204971.avif?t=1774550038\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALTERA is a military survival sandbox.  Become the ultimate troop commander &amp; lead your faction to victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a 64 km\u00b2 game world with diverse regions and unique points of interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for territory: over 40 areas can be captured and controlled by factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent world with customizable game rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with NPCs to receive quests and uncover dynamic world events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon modification and customization system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced base building and crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between first-person and third-person perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully dynamic day/night cycle and weather system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creation and customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faction management: develop infrastructure and assign missions to subordinates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Troop management: recruit, equip, and command soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression and skill development system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, in co-op, or host your own dedicated server.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE, PvP, or both combined\u00a0(custom game rules on every server).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Troops &amp; Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist soldiers who will follow you and execute your commands. Station soldiers on your bases and give them various tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/46b17468dc91b8e2f0a8b45880e8cad6.poster.avif?t=1774550038\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/46b17468dc91b8e2f0a8b45880e8cad6.webm?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/46b17468dc91b8e2f0a8b45880e8cad6.mp4?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Territory Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hostile factions and capture their territory. Protect your bases and territory from enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/8fe7b6db3c9d071e8b655af58b998347.poster.avif?t=1774550038\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/8fe7b6db3c9d071e8b655af58b998347.webm?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/8fe7b6db3c9d071e8b655af58b998347.mp4?t=1774550038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Building and Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use collected resources to build your own bases, facilities, and craft items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"